    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d604">

                <pb facs="0887" n="859" xml:id="pg859"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">330/9–1852: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in
                    Japan</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1952-09-18T18:30:00-04:00">September 18,
                            1952—6:30 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>734. In Sep 18 mtg US rejected USSR charge made Sep 17. USSR in rebuttal
                    continued bitter attack against US. Reiterated Amer colony theme and stated Jap
                    militaristic, citing Yoshida Aug 4 talk. Final vote 10–1 (USSR)–0.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
